{
  "name": "Save monthly full-page screenshots of your pages to Google Drive",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Save monthly full-page screenshots of your pages to Google Drive\n\n### Who's it for\nMarketers who keep a dated record of competitors' homepages and pricing pages, agencies that send clients a monthly visual report, and anyone who needs proof of what a page showed on a given day.\n\n### How it works\n1. On the 1st of every month **Monthly run** starts the workflow.\n2. **Pages to capture** reads the URLs from Google Sheets (column `url`).\n3. **Take screenshots** runs **Bulk Website Screenshot API & PDF** on Apify: one full-page image per URL (optionally a PDF too), lazy images loaded, cookie banners hidden, ads blocked, all in one ZIP.\n4. **Download ZIP** and **Save ZIP to Google Drive** keep the ZIP in your Drive (Apify deletes run files after its retention period, 7 days on the free plan).\n5. **Make log row** and **Log the run** add one row to Google Sheets: date, pages, saved, failed, the Drive link and the link to the run's results on Apify.\n\n### How to set up\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a tab `Pages` (column `url`, one page per row) and an empty tab `Runs`. Pick them in **Pages to capture** and **Log the run**.\n2. Create a **Header Auth** credential named `Apify API token`: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN` (Apify Console → Settings → API & Integrations). Select it in **Take screenshots** and **Download ZIP**.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and Google Drive. Pick the folder in **Save ZIP to Google Drive**.\n4. Run the workflow once, open the ZIP, then activate it.\n\n### Requirements\nApify account (the free plan includes $5 of usage a month), Google Sheets, Google Drive. Apify cost: $0.003 per screenshot on the free plan, plus $0.001 per PDF; failed URLs are not charged. 50 pages a month with PDFs cost about $0.20.\n\n### How to customize\n- Change the device (`desktop`, `laptop`, `tablet`, `mobile`), the format or `savePdf` in **Settings**.\n- Run it every week by changing **Monthly run**.\n- The run waits up to 5 minutes. For lists longer than about 50 pages, split them across two sheets or two runs.\n- Rows for failed URLs (404, timeouts, blocked pages) are in the Apify results link of each run.",
        "height": 1160,
        "width": 460
      },
